      "content": "i hear you about the counselors, but that's just more money we don't have, isn't it? it's a cycle. every time i think there's a way out, another bill comes or the car breaks down. i look at my wife and the kids and i just think... if i weren't here, they wouldn't have to deal with the stress of me. they could actually breathe. they wouldn't be carrying my mistakes around. it feels like the only way they'd actually get some relief is if i wasn't a constant drain on them.",
